\n    \n      \n        \n        \n        \n        \n          <iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"400\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?visual=true&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.soundcloud.com%2Ftracks%2F991250071&amp;show_artwork=true&amp;callback=YUI.Env.JSONP.yui_3_17_2_1_1614090011314_19581&amp;wmode=opaque\"></iframe>\n        \n        \n        \n      \n    \n  \n  \n    \n\n\n\n  \n</div>\n\n\n  <style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-95421ce139dbd1da00ab\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you\u2019re carried away on chemical waves</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">I want to touch you</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">When you\u2019re feeling like ice</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Your body so close that I could fall through</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cause you\u2019d give anything for one high</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">I wanna try to give you everything we had</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">But you\u2019re afraid of that life</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Don\u2019t wanna do anything anymore</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">And everything is alright, coming up out the ocean to the daylight</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">And everything is alright, drink it up, feel the abandon of your whole world</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">And everything is alright, cut it up, kill your emotions, light a cigarette</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Say everything is alright, staring out the window I doubt you feel your soul no more</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You say you\u2019re feeling no pain, been flying all night</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">But you\u2019re fading away, I\u2019m losing my mind</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Baby, I don\u2019t know why </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You say you\u2019d rather feel this for one night than live a whole life</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Baby, oh why?</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Are you gonna give in, or gonna give up?</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">And everything is alright, coming up out the ocean to the daylight</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">And everything is alright, drink it up, feel the abandon of your whole world</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">And everything is alright, cut it up, kill your emotions, light a cigarette</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Say everything is alright, staring out the window I doubt you feel your soul no more</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">I\u2019ve got a hold on you, I won\u2019t let you out</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-embed embed-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.embed/0900b03b-d66e-481d-84dc-498475291edd_738/website.components.embed.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definit