ains embedded code that has been disabled.&quot;,&quot;invalidThumbnail&quot;:&quot;Custom featured images only available with embedded videos. Go back into embed settings to turn off featured images.&quot;,&quot;invalidVideo&quot;:&quot;Invalid video embed.&quot;,&quot;playButton&quot;:&quot;Play&quot;,&quot;scriptDisabled&quot;:&quot;Script Disabled&quot;}\"\n  \n  \n>\n  \n  \n    \n    \n      \n        \n        \n        \n        \n          <iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"400\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?visual=true&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.soundcloud.com%2Ftracks%2F977336197&amp;show_artwork=true&amp;callback=YUI.Env.JSONP.yui_3_17_2_1_1612564501861_63219&amp;wmode=opaque\"></iframe>\n        \n        \n        \n      \n    \n  \n  \n    \n\n\n\n  \n</div>\n\n\n  <style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1612564501861_62107\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Your love was all I need</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Shut up and let me dream my fucked up dream</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">I\u2019m a broken down machine</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">I\u2019m rusted up and cold and can\u2019t feel clean</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Does your heartbeat make you wonder if you\u2019re living?</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Will it hurt me, or make me feel more human?</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cause I can feel us slip into oblivion dreaming of a future</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">And I don\u2019t wanna be another semi-dead invalid computer</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Your touch was all I need</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Beneath the rain of bombs and Dub MD\u2019s</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You tell me that I\u2019m free</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">But I\u2019m only killing time before the sleep</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br><br></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div></div></div></div>","excerpt":"","location":{"mapZoom":12.0,"mapLat":40.7207559,"mapLng":-74.00076130000002,"markerLat":40.7207559,"markerLng":-74.00076130000002,"addressTitle":"","addressLine1":"","addressLine2":"","addressCountry":""},"customContent":null,"likeCount":0,"commentCount":0,"publicCommentCount":0,"commentState":1,"unsaved":false,"author":{"id":"55e0f0f5e4b0eea3c349e57e","displayName":"Chad alburn","firstName":"Chad","lastName":"alburn","bio":""},"fullUrl":"/news/2021/2/5/i-can-feel-us-slip-into-oblivion","assetUrl":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55e8e2d5e4b071dc30cae0c0/1612566802563-B493370BED7TXMA1UIMT/558c06641df50bbc397325df61c9562b.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","items":[],"pushedServices":{},"pendingPushedServices":{},"seoData":{"seoHidden":false},"originalSize":"400x400","recordTypeLabel":"text"},{"id":"5ffb3c5d79a6bc1bd6174cb3","collectionId":"59ff8eabe31d1945638d3168","recordType":1,"addedOn":1610304084613,"updatedOn":1610304289869,"starred":false,"passthrough":false,"tags":[],"categories":[],"workflowState":1,"publishOn":1610304084613,"authorId":"55e0f0f5e4b0eea3c349e57e","systemDataId":"1610304270503-DOO4TTFL1MOVMMMQJZVC","systemDataVariants":"441x427,100w,300w","systemDataSourceType":"JPG","filename":"7a9bc3a6a2a07623213e11d91fa127fa.jpg","mediaFocalPoint":{"x":0.5,"y":0.5,"source":3},"colorData":{"topLeftAverage":"464d51","topRightAverage":"4b4a4d","bottomLeftAverage":"3e3f39","bottomRightAverage":"3e3f38","centerAverage":"474a53","suggestedBgColor":"434c49"},"urlId":"2021/1/10/notes-from-the-underground","title":"Notes from the underground","sourceUrl":"","body":"<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1610304084669\" id=\"item-5ffb3c5d79a6bc1bd6174cb3\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-dd454d9f27fc48ed21e9\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hello out there! It\u2019s been a while since we\u2019ve gotten update you all.  It\u2019s been a tough year, not just for us but for the whole world, a lot of time for introspection.  Music is a double edged sword \u2014 on the one hand it\u2019s what keeps us feeling fulfilled, and in the case of 2020, feeling sane.  On the other hand, it can be really hard work.  You start something new that feels special and it\u2019s like you\u2019re floating on air.  But getting it to the place where it feels ready for the world requires patience, both for us and anyone looking forward to hearing it.  Sometimes it takes a while for the right pieces to fall into place.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You churn through things so much, sometimes you wonder what it\u2019s for.  But if 2020 did anything, it put that question into clear focus; it\u2019s all about fostering human connection.  That\u2019s the thing every person in the world has yearned for collectively.  For making music though, that\u2019s always been the case regardless of the year \u2014 it\u2019s just been amplified. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The first part of that connection is with each other \u2014 my brother and I aren\u2019t able to physically see each other as much as we\u2019d like, but collaborating on this music is a way to feel connected that a phone call simply can\u2019t replicate.  It\u2019s a charge of energy that flows back and forth, unbounded by social distance.  When lacking in physical contact with friends, this is addictive, and a driving force behind how much we got done in the past year.  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The second part of that is with you, our fans. I would equate that feeling in two ways.  First, just by you playing one of our tracks, it\u2019s almost like I\u2019ve just told you a secret that I know I can trust you with \u2014 something I\u2019ve been wanting to get off my chest.  It\u2019s a sense of relief, and also gratitude that I have someone like you to tell it to.  The second way I can describe that feeling is like making a gift for someone special \u2014 you\u2019ve been thinking about it for months, toiling away in secret.  Then finally comes the moment you get to give it to them, watching to see the look on their face.  Then if you really nailed it, the big payoff \u2014 seeing them use the gift in the future.  Hopefully it\u2019s the thing they didn\u2019t even know they needed, and not the ill-fitting sweater you\u2019ve spent months knitting! </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Well, I\u2019m here to tell you about the thing you didn\u2019t know you needed \u2014 and you didn\u2019t know you needed it because it\u2019s been so damn long since we\u2019ve released anything.  But after a year of intense work, we are ready to share some new music with you, and our debut solo LP this spring.  Stay tuned and I hope it will find you well!</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div></div></div></div>","excerpt":"","location":{"mapZoom":12.0,"mapLat":40.7207559,"mapLng":-74.00076130000002,"markerLat":40.7207559,"markerLng":-74.00076130000002,"addressTitle":"","addressLine1":"","addressLine2":"","addressCountry":""},"customContent":null,"likeCount":0,"commentCount":0,"publicCommentCount":0,"commentState":1,"unsaved":false,"author":{"id":"55e0f0f5e4b0eea3c349e57e","displayName":"Chad alburn","firstName":"Chad","lastName":"alburn","bio":""},"fullUrl":"/news/2021/1/10/notes-from-the-underground","assetUrl":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55e8e2d5e4b071dc30cae0c0/1610304270503-DOO4TTFL1MOVMMMQJZVC/7a9bc3a6a2a07623213e11d91fa127fa.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","items":[],"pushedServices":{},"pendingPushedServices":{},"originalSize":"441x427","recordTypeLabel":"text"},{"id":"59ff8eb1ec212d4734b6d0cc","collectionId":"59ff8eabe31d1945638d3168","recordType":1,"addedOn":1509920504090,"updatedOn":1610304119415,"starred":false,"passthrough":false,"tags":[],"categories":[],"workflowState":1,"publishOn":1509920504090,"authorId":"55e0f0f5e4b0eea3c349e57e","systemDataId":"1509920481937-VXJATCZMJG1ZQJPIDF55","systemDataVariants":"500x477,100w,300w,500w","systemDataSourceType":"JPG","filename":"tumblr_m5xgbvB1v71qgg5o8o1_500.jpg","mediaFocalPoint":{"x":0.5,"y":0.5,"source":3},"colorData":{"topLeftAverage":"ececea","topRightAverage":"ededeb","bottomLeftAverage":"ededeb","bottomRightAverage":"ededeb","centerAverage":"d7d9da","suggestedBgColor":"ededeb"},"urlId":"2017/11/5/new-websitenew-music-coming","title":"New Website...New Music In The Works!!!","sourceUrl":"","body":"","excerpt":"","location":{"mapZoom":12.0,"mapLat":40.7207559,"mapLng":-74.00076130000002,"markerLat":40.7207559,"markerLng":-74.00076130000002,"addressTitle":"","addressLine1":"","addressLine2":"","addressCountry":""},"customContent":null,"likeCount":0,"commentCount":1,"publicCommentCount":1,"commentState":1,"unsaved":false,"author":{"id":"55e0f0f5e4b0eea3c349e57e","displayName":"Chad alburn","firstName":"Chad","lastName":"alburn","bio":""},"fullUrl":"/news/2017/11/5/new-websitenew-music-coming","assetUrl":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55e8e2d5e4b071dc30cae0c0/1509920481937-VXJATCZMJG1ZQJPIDF55/tumblr_m5xgbvB1v71qgg5o8o1_500.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","items":[],"pushedServices":{},"pendingPushedServices":{},"originalSize":"500x477","recordTypeLabel":"text"}],"pagePreviewContext":{"isPreviewMode":false,"memberAccessUrl":"/news?format=json&requestAccess=true"}}